=3 English translation
When I set out{br}The only footsteps{br}Were my own.
Yet as I traveled,{br}Ever more voices were{br}Added to my chorus.
A chorus that echoed throughout{br}the land...of Vana'diel.
Adventurers...children of Altana...{br}Gather now, proud before the crystals.
And as I strove ever forward{br}The voices called out to me
Giving answers I never heard before.
Never had I felt so safe{br}As my spirit soared toward the sky.
Together we are more than when we stand alone{br}Protecting the land...of Vana'diel.
And we press ever forward...{br}And the sun never sets.
